    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a19717ce223a9ae596f7438e",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "“一筋の黄金”を見つける，私の旅に。",
      "source_fingerprint": "825376b8a532bf24a2fda528f62cda9121730424eb3d9b2f782f129f46e8c879",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1119/storytimeline_501119100.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        28,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/28/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:34032b0fae18f53473697ece",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "――自分もかつて，\nステイゴールドの走りに憧れ，夢を見た。\nそれは，梦之旅と同じだ。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ad27a374dafb350f25f9d60557a7c918afff26d72bbba2ef00fce253f995601e",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1119/storytimeline_501119100.json",
      "json_path": [
