    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4b2b42804d1676ca106e6f29",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "……それが，アネゴの――",
      "source_fingerprint": "e2986dd3ae43b9d2278c7e31e9ea98ed9461bcf139cce4d58f83e207b19dba3d",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1119/storytimeline_501119100.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        3,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/3/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1533db7bbc52de78a64ce991",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "そして今は……\n梦之旅の走りそのものに，\nトレーナーとして夢を抱いている。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d54798ffb331bb15eed67a18ac33977d1d1c03993897dec79722a36fa496a4c8",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1119/storytimeline_501119100.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        30,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/30/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3a34121f62d04ff45b17ddac",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "あの日梦之旅が見せた，\n鮮烈な走り――",
      "source_fingerprint": "574809400d32ad11d06ef3544e6c69b4b1687f93735243265b8f6b7aff954394",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1119/storytimeline_501119100.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        31,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/31/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7e7542f803f4e7da9f1a918f",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "その旅が行きつく“果て”がどこにあるのか。\n確かめてみたい。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c9de027e277092c2d62b146e6cfbfa2020aa93b84a99d1d4e671eb59e0b24e74",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1119/storytimeline_501119100.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        32,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/32/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:36d1ed4839f293c6d9f3a14d",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "そんな欲求が……\n自分の心を放してくれないのだ。",
      "source_fingerprint": "8c981242ee45e11b37e5fecca6ca0efe0285925a7deb4946f92e07ea72b4ed36",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1119/storytimeline_501119100.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        33,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/33/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7cc2b3e626881b3fe1b209f5",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "彼女が纏う重厚な香りを，\n決して忘れられないように――",
      "source_fingerprint": "c28c996f3c372cab6f3287474a6bb6bb059aa180d1d06bcc23abe5f4a4bd44cb",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1119/storytimeline_501119100.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        34,
