    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:616859a753766436946a65e6",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "…………では，ここまでで，\n何か確認しておきたいことはありますか？",
      "source_fingerprint": "406a51a09e9941cd9ad7def439dfec810a34bb5a67680aa08561587e143691e7",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1119/storytimeline_501119100.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        35,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/35/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b29dcdd7fc32b6db4a83ec4d",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "……君の考える“旅”とは，どんなものだ？",
      "source_fingerprint": "55cc8389f686bb00ae5e9431830e32adaf2c4a5f10b2bc9644a50e6378563215",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1119/storytimeline_501119100.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        36,
        "choice_data_list",
        0
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/36/choice_data_list/0"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d6f44c3ccb3a46bb4d88dd86",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "……貴方の考える“旅”とは，どんなもの？",
      "source_fingerprint": "b5faa32526f8cb7410294697abbf36df7e199a16634a134ee5790dfdb474b0d6",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1119/storytimeline_501119100.json",
