      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/36/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6b2e16a7a58d06ad5c182e98",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "それは果たして，ステイゴールドのように\n多くのレースを駆けることなのか。",
      "source_fingerprint": "42d1e84ec648cab5fbd5d278c6223c35c6eef21412c6966085b918956a4ecd5a",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1119/storytimeline_501119100.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        37,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/37/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f0c28ea58976f80a199e1b00",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "あるいは，別の意味が含まれているのか。",
      "source_fingerprint": "5874ab7b567e22bf3fddd68fd583edd3748291b3b45b376d1328c693d752471f",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1119/storytimeline_501119100.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        38,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/38/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0f78cc67faf8b1497f54d5f4",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "彼女と共にこれから旅をするにあたり，\nそこに認識のズレがあってはいけないはずだ。",
      "source_fingerprint": "9dde388a88106d306e8853a7a89348d76e20ce3d647df864f31dca421e4cd21f",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
